    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25375" root="صيف" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْيَافٌ</span></b> , applied to land (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>), <i>Having in it
abundance of the rain of the</i> [<i>season called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْف</span>.
(O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And, so applied, <i>Late in producing
herbage.</i> (O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصِيفٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  [Hence,]
(tropical:)  A man <i>who does not take a wife until he has
whiteness in the hair of his head mixed with the
blackness thereof.</i> (O, K.)

